hadiths[50]{hadithnumber,text}:
"260","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Qasam hai us Zaat ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai tum Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoge jab tak tum iman na lao aur tum momin nahin ho sakte jab tak tum aapas mein muhabbat na karo kya main tumhen aisi cheez na bataun ke jab tum use baja lao to aapas mein muhabbat karne lago aapas mein salam ko phelao muhabbat karo ge aur bughz o dushmani se bacho pas beshak woh mundne wali hai main nahin kehta ke balon ko mundne wali lekin deen ko mundne wali hai aur Ibrahim bin Usaid se dusri sanad se is jaisi riwayat marvi hai."
"261","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Beshak momino ki roohen ek din ki musafat par mil leti hain jabke un mein se ek ne apne sathi ko dekha bhi nahin hota."
"262","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya Nemat ki nashukri ki jati hai aur rishtedari kati jati hai aur main ne ulfat se zyada mardon ke dilon ke mushabeh koi cheez nahin dekhi."
"263","Umair bin Ishaq rahimahullah ne kaha Hum kehte the ke beshak logon se sab se pehle jo cheez uthai jayegi woh ulfat o muwaddat hai."
"264","Hazrat Anas raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni baaz biwiyon ke paas tashrif laye aur goya Hazrat Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha un mein maujud thin pas Aap ne farmaya Ae Unaisa sheeshiyon ke sath aahista Abu Qilaba ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un aurton ko is ka hukm is liye diya ke agar tum mein se koi aisi baat kahe jo achchi na ho pas beshak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne yeh kehna chaha ke mashkizon ke sath aahista."
"265","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool beshak Aap hum se mazaq farmate hain farmaya Beshak main agarche tum se mazaq karta hun magar main haq ke siwa kuch nahin kehta."
"266","Bakar bin Abdullah rahimahullah ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba mazaq mein ek dusre par tarbooz se nishanabazi karte the phir jab muamla sanjidgi ka hota to wahi mard hote the."
"267","Ibn Abi Mulaika rahimahullah ne kaha Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas mazaq ka ek jumla kaha pas un ki walida ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool beshak Bani Kinana ke kuch log mazaq ki baat lekar aaye pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Balke hum un ki baton mein se kehte hain."
"268","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas sawari mangne aaya pas farmaya Main tumhen oontni ke bachche par sawar karunga Us ne kaha Ae Allah ke Rasool main oontni ke bachche ka kya karunga Farmaya Aur oontni ke siwa oont ko kaun janti hai."
"269","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam hum se ghul mil jaya karte the hatta ke woh mere ek chhote bhai se kaha karte the Ae Abu Umair Nughair ka kya hua."
"270","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Hasan ya Husain raziyallahu anhuma ka hath pakda aur un ke dono qadam apne mubarak qadam par rakhe phir farmaya Upar chadho."
"271","Hazrat Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Husn e akhlaq se zyada wazni koi cheez meezaan mein nahin hai."
"272","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam na fahsh goi karte the na takalluf se fahsh goi ikhtiyar karte the, aur farmaya karte the: tum me se behtar woh hain jo akhlaq me tum me se sab se achhe hain."
"273","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya: main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: kya main tumhen na bataun ke tum me se mujhe sab se zyada mehboob aur qayamat ke din majlis ke etebar se mujh se sab se zyada qareeb kaun hoga, to log khamosh rahe, to Aap ne apni baat do ya teen martaba dohrai, to logon ne kaha: kyun nahin ya Rasoolullah, Aap ne farmaya: tum me se jo akhlaq me sab se achhe hain."
"274","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: mujhe sirf is liye bheja gaya hai taake main umdah akhlaq ki takmeel karun."
"275","Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko jab bhi do kamon me ikhtiyar diya gaya to Aap ne un dono me se zyada aasan ko ikhtiyar farmaya jab tak woh gunah na ho, phir agar woh gunah hota to Aap logon me se us se sab se zyada door rehte, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne liye kabhi inteqam na liya magar yeh ke Allah ki hurmat pamal ki jaye to phir Allah azza wa jalla ke liye inteqam lete."
"276","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: beshak Allah Taala ne tumhare darmiyan tumhare akhlaq taqseem farmaye hain jis tarah tumhare darmiyan tumhare rizq taqseem farmaye hain, aur beshak Allah Taala maal use bhi deta hai jis se woh muhabbat karta hai aur use bhi jis se woh muhabbat nahin karta, aur iman sirf use deta hai jis se woh muhabbat karta hai, pas jo shakhs kharch karne me bakheel ho aur dushman se ladne se darta ho aur raat ko qiyam karne ki apne dil me himmat na pata ho to use chahiye ke La ilaha illallah, Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah aur Allahu Akbar kehna kasrat se kare."
"277","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: duniyawi saman ki kasrat ka naam ghina nahin hai lekin asal ghina dil ka ghina hai."
"278","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki das saal khidmat ki to Aap ne mujhe kabhi uf tak na kaha, aur jo kaam main ne na kiya us par kabhi na farmaya: tum ne yeh kyun na kiya, aur jo kaam main ne kiya us par kabhi na farmaya: tum ne yeh kyun kiya."
"279","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam tamam logon se zyada rehem karne wale aur shafqat karne wale the, koi mangne wala Aap ke pas na aaya magar Aap ne use wada farmaya, phir agar Aap ke pas kuch hota to use ata farma dete, phir ek din aisa hua ke namaz ke liye iqamat keh di gai thi ke ek dehati Aap ke pas aaya aur Aap ki chadar pakad li aur kaha: meri ek thodi si baat reh gai hai mujhe darr hai ke main use bhool jaunga, meri baat sun lijiye, to Aap us ke sath khade rahe yahan tak ke woh apni baat se farigh ho gaya, phir Aap tashreef laye aur namaz parhai."
"280","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se jab bhi koi cheez mangi gai to Aap ne kabhi la na farmaya."
"281","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya: main ne Hazrat Ayesha aur Hazrat Asma raziyallahu anhuma se barh kar sakhi do aurton ko nahin dekha, aur un dono ka sakhawat ka tareeqa mukhtalif tha, rahi Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha to woh cheez jama karti rehtin yahan tak ke jab un ke pas kuch jama ho jata to use kharch kar detin, aur rahi Hazrat Asma raziyallahu anha to woh kal ke liye bacha kar nahin rakhtin thin, jo kuch un ke pas aata use kharch kar detin."
"282","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah ke raste ka ghubaar aur jahannam ka dhuan kabhi kisi bande ke andar jama nahin honge, aur bakhl aur iman kabhi kisi bande ke dil me jama nahin honge."
"283","Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: do khaslaten kisi momin me jama nahin hotin: bakhl aur bad akhlaqi."
"284","Abdullah bin Rabia rahimahullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Hazrat Ibn Masud raziyallahu anhu ke paas the to ek shakhs ka zikr hua to us ke akhlaq ka zikr hua, to Hazrat Ibn Masud raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Batao agar tum us ka sar kaat do to kya tum use wapas la sakte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: To us ka haath? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: To us ka paon? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Hazrat Ibn Masud raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Pas jab tum us ki khilqat ko badalne ki taqat nahi rakhte to tum us ke akhlaq ko badalne ki taqat nahi rakhte, beshak nutfa rehem me chalees raatein rehta hai, phir alaqa ban jata hai, phir mudgha ban jata hai, phir Allah Taala ek farishta bhejta hai pas woh us ka rizq aur us ka akhlaq aur us ka badbakht ya saadatmand hona likh deta hai."
"285","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi apne husn e akhlaq ki wajah se raat ko qiyam karne wale ke darje tak pahunch jata hai."
"286","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Abul Qasim sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Islam me tum me se behtareen woh hai jis ka akhlaq achcha ho jab woh deen me samajh hasil kare."
"287","Sabit bin Ubaid rahimahullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit raziyallahu anhu se badh kar ashaab ki majlison me zyada bawaqar aur apne ghar me zyada mazah karne wala koi shakhs nahi dekha."
"288","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se poocha gaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ko kaun sa deen zyada mehboob hai? To Aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Narm aasan Hanifi deen."
"289","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Agar tumhein chaar cheezein ata kar di jayein to duniya ke muamle me se jo cheez tum se fout ho jaye woh tumhein nuqsan nahi degi: husn e akhlaq, halal khana, baat ki sachchai aur amanat ki hifazat."
"290","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho sab se zyada kaun si cheez logon ko aag me dakhil karegi? Unhon ne arz kiya: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Sharmgah aur munh, aur sab se zyada kaun si cheez logon ko jannat me dakhil karegi Allah ka taqwa aur husn e akhlaq."
"291","Hazrat Umm Darda raziyallahu anha se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Hazrat Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu raat ko namaz ke liye khare hue to rone lage aur kehne lage: Ae Allah Tune meri khilqat achchi banai hai pas mere akhlaq achche kar de. Pas woh isi par rahe yahan tak ke subah ho gai. To maine kaha: Ae Abu Darda, aap subah tak husn e akhlaq hi ki dua karte rahe! To unhon ne farmaya: Ae Umm Darda, beshak musalman banda jab us ka akhlaq achcha hota hai to woh use jannat me dakhil kar deta hai, aur jab us ka akhlaq bura hota hai to woh use aag me dakhil kar deta hai, aur beshak musalman banda jab sota hai to use bakhsh diya jata hai. To maine kaha: Ae Abu Darda, sone wale ko kaise bakhsha jata hai? Unhon ne kaha: Beshak us ka bhai raat ko uth kar tahajjud ki namaz padhta hai phir Allah Taala se dua karta hai pas us ke haq me qubool ki jati hai, phir woh apne bhai ke liye dua karta hai pas us ke bhai ke haq me qubool ki jati hai."
"292","Hazrat Usama bin Sharik raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Main Hajj me Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas tha to dehati aaye, kuch log idhar se aur kuch log udhar se, to log khamosh rahe aur un ke siwa koi baat na kar saka. Pas unhon ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya falan falan kaam me hum par koi gunah hai? Pas unhon ne aisi cheezein zikr kein jin me un par koi harj na tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne tangi aur mushakkat utha di hai, siwae us shakhs ke jo zulman apne bhai ka gosht khaye to woh harj aur halakat me hai. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya hum ilaaj karayein? Aap ne farmaya: Ilaaj karayo ae Allah ke bando, pas beshak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne koi beemari nazil nahi ki magar us ke liye dawa nazil ki hai, siwae ek beemari ke. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, woh kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Budhapa. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, insan ko jo sab se afzal aur behtareen cheez di gai hai woh kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Husn e akhlaq."
"293","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam sab logon se zyada sakhi the, aur Ramazan me sab se zyada sakhi hote jab Jibril Ameen Aap se mulaqat karte, aur Jibril alaihissalam Ramazan ki har raat Aap se mulaqat karte pas Aap se Quran ka daur karte, pas jab Jibril Aap se mulaqat karte to Aap bhalai me tez chalti hawa se bhi zyada sakhi hote."
"294","Hazrat Abu Masud Ansari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle logon me se ek shakhs ka hisab hua to us ke liye koi neki na pai gai siwae is ke ke woh logon se mil jul rakhta tha aur maal daar tha, pas woh apne ghulamon aur larkon ko hukm deta tha ke tangdast se darguzar karein. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Hum is ke us se zyada haqdar hain, pas us se darguzar karo."
"295","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se poocha gaya: Sab se zyada kaun si cheez jannat me dakhil karegi? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ka taqwa aur husn e akhlaq. Unhon ne arz kiya: To sab se zyada kaun si cheez aag me dakhil karegi? Aap ne farmaya: Munh aur sharmgah."
"296","Hazrat Nawas bin Saman Ansari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se neki aur gunah ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne farmaya: Neki husn e akhlaq hai, aur gunah woh hai jo tumhare dil mein khatke aur tum napasand karo ke log us par muttala hon."
"297","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Bani Salma, tumhara sardar kaun hai, hum ne arz kiya: Judayy bin Qais, magar hum use bakhil shumar karte hain, Aap ne farmaya: Aur bakhl se barh kar kaun si bimari hai, balke tumhara sardar Amr bin Jamuh hai, aur Amr bin Jamuh jahiliyyat mein apne buton ka mutawalli tha, phir jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam nikah karte to woh Aap ke walime ka ehtimam karta tha."
"298","Hazrat Warrad jo Mughira ke katib hain raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Hazrat Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ne Hazrat Mughira bin Shuba raziyallahu anhu ko likha ke mujhe koi aisi hadith likh bhejo jo tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suni ho, to Mughira ne likha: Beshak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam qeel o qaal se, maal zaya karne se, kasrat e sawal se, aur ata mein ehsan jatane se, maon ki nafarmani se, aur betiyon ko zinda dafn karne se mana farmate the."
"299","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se jo cheez bhi kabhi mangi gayi to Aap ne kabhi la nahin farmaya."
"300","Hazrat Amr bin Aas raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe hukm diya ke main Aap ke paas apne jangi kapron aur hathiyaron ke sath hazir hon, to maine aisa hi kiya, phir jab main Aap ke paas aaya to Aap wuzu farma rahe the, to Aap ne meri taraf nazar uthayi phir apna sar jhuka liya, phir farmaya: Ae Amr, main chahta hon ke tumhe ek lashkar par rawana karun aur Allah tumhe ghanimat ata farmaye, aur main tumhare liye maal mein se umda hissa chahta hon, to maine arz kiya: Main maal ke liye Islam nahin laya, balke maine Islam ki raghbat ke liye Islam qabool kiya hai aur is liye ke main Rasoolullah ke sath rahon, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Amr, saleh aadmi ke liye saleh maal kya hi khub hai."
"301","Hazrat Ubaidullah bin Mihsan Ansari raziyallahu anhu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo shakhs apne ghar mein aman o itminan ke sath subah kare, apne jism mein aafiyat wala ho, us ke paas us din ki rozi ho, to goya sari duniya us ke liye jama kar di gayi."
"302","Hazrat Ubaida bin Abd al Hayy raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashrif laye aur Aap par ghusl ka asar tha aur Aap khush chehra the, to hum ne guman kiya ke Aap apni ahliya ke paas se farigh hue hain, to hum ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, hum Aap ko aaj khush chehra dekh rahe hain, to Aap ne farmaya: Alhamdulillah, aisa hi hai, phir maal dari aur faraakhi ka zikr hua, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Taqwa ke sath maal dari mein koi harj nahin, aur muttaqi ke liye aafiyat maal dari se behtar hai, aur dil ka itminan Allah ki nematon mein se hai."
"303","Hazrat Nawas bin Saman Ansari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se neki aur gunah ke bare mein pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Neki husn e akhlaq hai, aur gunah woh hai jo tumhare seene mein khatke aur tum napasand karo ke log us par muttala hon."
"304","Hazrat Anas raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tamam logon se barh kar khubsurat chehre wale, sab se zyada sakhi haath wale aur sab se zyada bahadur the, ek raat ahle Madina ghabra gaye, to log aawaz ki taraf rawana hue, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un se mile jabke Aap tanha sab logon se pehle aawaz ki taraf pahunch chuke the, aur Aap farma rahe the: Darne ki koi baat nahin, ghabrao mat, aur Aap Abu Talha ke ek baghair zeen wale ghore par sawar the aur Aap ki gardan mein talwar thi, phir Aap ne farmaya: Hum ne is ghore ko samandar paya, ya farmaya: Beshak ye to samandar hai."
"305","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Har neki sadqa hai, aur beshak neki mein se hai ke tum apne bhai se khush chehre se milo, aur apne dol se apne bhai ke bartan mein pani dal do."
"306","Hazrat Abu Dharr raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pucha gaya: Kaun se aamal afzal hain, Aap ne farmaya: Allah par iman lana aur Us ke raste mein jihad karna, arz kiya gaya: To kaun si gardan aazad karna afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki qeemat zyada ho aur jo apne walon ke nazdeek nafees ho, arz kiya gaya: Phir agar main aisa na kar sakun, Aap ne farmaya: To tum kisi karigar ki madad karo ya kisi na samajh ke liye kaam karo, arz kiya gaya: Phir agar main aisa na kar sakun, Aap ne farmaya: To tum logon se apna shar rok lo, kyunke ye tumhari taraf se tumhari jaan par sadqa hai."
"307","Hazrat Abu Musa Ashari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqa hai, Sahaba ne arz kiya: Phir agar woh na paye, Aap ne farmaya: To woh apne hathon se kaam kare phir apne aap ko faida pahunchaye aur sadqa kare, Sahaba ne arz kiya: Phir agar woh istetaat na rakhe ya aisa na kare, Aap ne farmaya: To woh hajatmand faryadi ki madad kare, Sahaba ne arz kiya: Phir agar woh istetaat na rakhe ya aisa na kare, Aap ne farmaya: To woh neki ka hukm de, Sahaba ne arz kiya: Phir agar woh istetaat na rakhe ya aisa na kare, Aap ne farmaya: To woh shar se ruk jaye, kyunke ye us par sadqa hai."
"308","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam kasrat se yeh farmaya karte the ke Ae Allah beshak main Tujh se aafiyat aur iffat aur amanat aur husn-e-akhlaq aur taqdeer par razamandi ka sawal karta hun."
"309","Abdur Rahman bin Shaiba ne hum se hadith bayan ki unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Ibn Abi al-Fudaik ne khabar di unhon ne Kaseer bin Zaid se unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah ko kabhi kisi par laanat karte hue nahi suna na kisi insan par aur Salim kehte the ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya ke momin ke liye munasib nahi ke woh bahut laanat karne wala ho."
